<title>USA: Vornado gets $600 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Vornado gets $600 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vornado Realty Trust said Thursday it obtained a $600 million unsecured three-year revolving credit facility from a bank group led by Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>In connection with this facility, Vornado said it terminated a prior term loan facility for $400 million.</p>
</text>
